      "bbox": {
        "l": 63.61029999999998,
        "t": 713.2809,
        "r": 524.9239000000011,
        "b": 662.4047999999998
      },
      "content": "Example: If operating at a pressure of 10 bar(e) in an ambient temperature of 20 °C and at a relative air humidity of 100%, the minimum temperature to prevent condensate from forming is 68 °C . Regulate the cooling water flow during loaded operation to obtain a temperature between 70 and approx. 75 °C  at the outlet of the compressor element."
    },
